9. Do not mutate events

Suppose on August 17 2026:

Archive.org claims:
author = X

and six months later you discover that is wrong.

Do not:

UPDATE assertion SET author='Y'

You append:

Assertion A
X authored Work W
then
AssertionRetracted(A)
then
Assertion B
Y authored Work W

Current state says Y.

History says exactly what happened.

