10. This solves the scary question you asked

What if we ingest millions of records and later realise our schema is wrong?

That’s completely survivable if the original records/events remain immutable.

Example.

2026 schema

Perhaps idiotically:

WorkV1 {
    title
    author_id
}

Then by 2027 you correctly realise:

authorship is contested
multiple authors possible
roles vary
