    subject = Work
    predicate = AUTHORED_BY

Then write an explicit migration:

WorkV1 → WorkV2

which converts:

v1.author_id

into:

AuthorshipAssertion {
    source = LEGACY_SCHEMA_MIGRATION
    source_event = ...
}

Your old historical object still exists exactly as written.

Your new projection is better.

