14. Define Pāṭala compatibility rules

I’d use semantic versioning, but define it more strictly than normal software SemVer.

PATCH

1.2.0 → 1.2.1

Only:

description
examples
documentation
annotations

No validation or semantic behavior change.

MINOR

1.2 → 1.3

Backward-readable additions:

new OPTIONAL property
new OPTIONAL relationship
new extension metadata

MAJOR

1 → 2

Anything like:

required field change
type change
meaning change
relationship semantics change
structural redesign

