OpenAlex is an excellent model for the read plane, not the epistemic archive.

OpenAlex uses stable entity IDs, encourages clients to resolve names to identifiers first, supports canonical external IDs such as DOI/ORCID/ROR, and when duplicate entities are merged an old OpenAlex ID returns an HTTP 301 to the surviving ID. 

